WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Wellington vs. Royal Palm. A free kick under the floodlights.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.800
The free kick wins the match for Wellington.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:13.400
The camera swings back across the field after the goal.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:22.010
Players regroup as the touchline comes back into view.
